From: Cristian Papa <pcristian292@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] MIPS: demote temporary XR500v boot markers to debug

The cold-boot investigation is complete. Keep the former emergency markers
available as debug messages without printing them on every production boot.
Functional initialization and existing error messages are unchanged.

Signed-off-by: Cristian Papa <pcristian292@gmail.com>

